        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia FLORDB, Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Cylinder Ornate Deadbolt is over-the-top but that is what makes it so grand. In a world where everything is plain, why not add a little glamor to your home? A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. The Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 4 finishes exclusive to Omnia's Classico Collection--specially designed to make the intricate details of this deadbolt shine. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-scallop-brass.jpg?v=1704354527\" width=\"600\" height=\"228\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia FLORDB Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 cylinder with collar, 1 thumbturn, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, strike, and dust box.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia FLORDB Single Cylinder Classico Collection Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia FLORDB Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Ornate Deadbolt",
                "description": "Omnia FLORDB, Single Cylinder Ornate Deadbolt - The Single Cylinder Ornate Deadbolt is over-the-top but that is what makes it so grand. In a world where everything is  plain, why not add a little glamor to your home? A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. Choose the Classico Collection's specially designed finishes: Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel. Omnia's FLORDB Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses.",
                "keywords": "OMN-FLORDB, Omnia FLORDB Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Single Cylinder Ornate Deadbolts, Omnia FLORDB single cylinder door locks, fancy door locks, fancy deadbolts, omnia deadbolts, omnia classico collections, Ornate Single Cylinder Deadbolts,"
